==English==
[[File:Caribou.jpg|thumb|a '''reindeer''' ({{taxfmt|Rangifer tarandus|species}})]]
{{wikispecies|Rangifer tarandus}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|reyndere}}, {{m|enm|reynder}}, {{m|enm|rayne-dere}}, from {{der|en|non|hreindýri|t=reindeer}}, from {{m|non|hreinn|t=reindeer}} + {{m|non|dýr|t=animal}}. Compare {{cog|nl|rendier|t=reindeer}}, {{cog|de|Rentier|t=reindeer}}, {{cog|sv|rendjur|t=reindeer}}, {{cog|da|rensdyr|t=reindeer}}. Related also to displaced {{cog|ang|hrān|t=reindeer}}. Unrelated to [[rein]].

